msgid "Uploads a complete image of the storage target and replaces it, identity fields and calibration data included. The previous image is kept as /tmp/pon-board-data.*.bin."
msgstr "上传存储目标的完整镜像并整体替换，身份字段与校准数据一并覆盖。原镜像另存为 /tmp/pon-board-data.*.bin。"

