msgstr "SIP 信令报文的 DSCP 标记。"

msgid "Media DSCP"
msgstr "媒体 DSCP"

msgid "DSCP mark of the voice packets."
msgstr "语音报文的 DSCP 标记。"

msgid "Registration period (s)"
msgstr "注册周期(秒)"

msgid "How often the gateway registers again."
msgstr "网关重新注册的时间间隔。"

msgid "Registration retry period (s)"
msgstr "注册重试周期(秒)"

msgid "How soon a failed registration is retried."
msgstr "注册失败后隔多久重试。"

msgid "Session update period (min)"
msgstr "会话更新周期(分钟)"

msgid "How often an established call refreshes its session."
msgstr "已建立的呼叫刷新会话的时间间隔。"

msgid "Minimum session update period (min)"
msgstr "最小会话更新周期(分钟)"

msgid "Shortest session refresh interval accepted from the server."
msgstr "接受服务器下发的最小会话刷新间隔。"

msgid "Enable heartbeat"
msgstr "启用心跳"

msgid "Detect whether the server is still reachable while no call is up."
msgstr "在没有通话时检测服务器是否仍然可达。"

msgid "Heartbeat timeout count"
msgstr "心跳超时次数"

msgid "Heartbeat timeouts before the registration is refreshed."
msgstr "触发重新注册前允许的心跳超时次数。"

msgid "Gain, echo cancellation and the identity of every FXS port. The two shipped sections are the two FXS ports of the device; the authentication credentials apply to the SIP voice protocols."
msgstr "每个 FXS 端口的增益、回声抑制与身份标识。默认的两个配置段对应设备的两个 FXS 端口；鉴权凭据用于 SIP 语音协议。"

msgid "Authentication user name"
msgstr "鉴权用户名"

msgid "User name the line authenticates with."
msgstr "该线路用于认证的用户名。"

msgid "Authentication password"
msgstr "鉴权密码"

msgid "Phone number"
msgstr "电话号码"

msgid "Number presented to the called party."
msgstr "呈现给被叫方的号码。"
